<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Essex High School \(EHS\) provides a rigorous and varied curriculum in order to support every student with access to state graduation requirements and to support students in pursuing individual interests. Courses listed in this Program of Studies may change due to insufficient enrollment, budgetary constraints, staffing changes, or other factors, including changes in state and/or national curriculum.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
