/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Computer Animation I focuses on learning the basics of creating digital animation. Topics include how to create 2d and 3d models effectively and how to render still images and video. We will use industry standard animation software to create exciting 3d objects and short animations. If you possess a bit of computer savvy and have a passion for animation, this course is for you.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [20]
>>
